  message: "PR #2200, 2026-11-16: the robot and twig members named in this title are DONE (robot `test_case` -> `test`, twig `function_call` -> `call_site`; node id and stable id now hash Symbol.kind; harbor tests: 173 of 1,474 robot symbols moved, every `test`; twig measured on a fixture only). The nine analyzers (fennel, gleam, hack, haxe, janet, odin, prisma, tcl, v_lang) still hash a role word into the stable id and were NOT changed: that is this item, still open, and it moves ids (next bump). The title still names robot and twig; retitling is the owner's call."  # 7028
